# Firebase / FCM — never commit (google-services.json is config; the
# service-account key is a live secret). Supply these locally, like keystore.properties.
# The whole FCM/ dir is ignored because service-account keys have unpredictable names
# (e.g. <project>-<hash>.json).
FCM/
google-services.json
app/google-services.json
**/google-services.json
*service-account*.json
fcm-*.json
